{"unit_id":"tag:00VV:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为范畴（category）。设 <MATH_0002> 和 <MATH_0003> 为两个具有同一固定目标的态射族（families of morphisms）。\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 如果 <MATH_0004> 与 <MATH_0005> 组合等价（combinatorially equivalent），那么它们同义地（tautologically）等价（equivalent）。\n<STRUCT_0003> 如果 <MATH_0006> 与 <MATH_0007> 同义地（tautologically）等价（equivalent），那么 <MATH_0008> 是 <MATH_0009> 的一个加细（refinement），且 <MATH_0010> 是 <MATH_0011> 的一个加细（refinement）。\n<STRUCT_0004> “组合等价（combinatorially equivalent）”这一关系（relation），是所有具有固定目标的态射族（families of morphisms）上的等价关系（equivalence relation）。\n<STRUCT_0005> “同义地（tautologically）等价（equivalent）”这一关系（relation），是所有具有固定目标的态射族（families of morphisms）上的等价关系（equivalence relation）。\n<STRUCT_0006> “<MATH_0012> 加细（refines）<MATH_0013> 且 <MATH_0014> 加细（refines）<MATH_0015>”这一关系（relation），是所有具有固定目标的态射族（families of morphisms）上的等价关系（equivalence relation）。\n<STRUCT_0007>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"combinatorially equivalent","target_term":"组合等价"},{"source_term":"tautologically","target_term":"同义地"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"tautologically","target_term":"同义地"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"refinement","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"combinatorially equivalent","target_term":"组合等价"},{"source_term":"relation","target_term":"关系"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系"},{"source_term":"tautologically","target_term":"同义地"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"relation","target_term":"关系"},{"source_term":"families of morphisms","target_term":"态射族"},{"source_term":"equivalence relation","target_term":"等价关系"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"source_term":"refines","target_term":"加细"},{"sour